<title>HUNGARY: Graboplast boosts stake in Sotex unit.</title>
<headline>Graboplast boosts stake in Sotex unit.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian home improvement product manufacturer Graboplast Rt said on Monday that it raised its stake in its carpet subsidary Sotex Rt to 71.8 percent via a capital increase.</p>
<p>Graboplast had raised Sotex's share capital by 162 million forints to 1.08 billion via a private share issue, approved at a general meeting on January 9, Graboplast said in the official bourse gazette.</p>
<p>On Friday Graboplast shares ended at 5,950 forints, down 250.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
